// Every value in Alibi's signatures has a type, with no exception: name the
// type, or write a type alias for it, instead of untyped, which Steep accepts
// anywhere and checks nowhere. This covers the RBS files under sig/ and
// tasks/sig/, and the inline annotations a Ruby file can carry.
files "{**/*.{rbs,rb,rake},Rakefile,Steepfile,exe/*}"
pattern #"\buntyped\b"#
